Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.06,0:00:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My son, my precious boy has been murdered!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sense the misfortune\Nthat has befallen my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bond between mother\Nand son has spoken!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My precious, beautiful boy, you\Ndied covered with wounds like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.20,0:00:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.96,0:00:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.70,0:00:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suffer the same pain you felt!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:59.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were utterly magnificent as you\Nfought for Lord Dio, my dear centerfold!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did they do it to kill such\Na noble and pure soul like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.56,0:01:11.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must have done something underhanded!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop them!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:23.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will make sure they pay a terrifying\Nprice with the Empress card!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll regret the day they were born!
