Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't stand idle!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time for action!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.86,0:01:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A time for vengeance with a\Nstand that brings a slow death!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.84,0:01:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The anguish, the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.26,0:01:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.74,0:02:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one who's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.38,0:03:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the one who's going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
