Dialogue: 2,0:03:32.40,0:03:36.82,Title 3,ep,0,0,0,,{\fad(740,668)\pos(192,815)}Episode 12: The Empress
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't usually get on a soapbox like\Nthis, but stupid people are just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could repeat something a million\Ntimes over and they still won't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.86,0:03:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know the type, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's just no helping the poor souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know, uh, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never got your name, did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.22,0:03:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nena.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.18,0:03:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nena, that's a great name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daughter of a wealthy family in the sacred\Ncity Varanasi that we're passing through,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.90,0:03:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.81,0:04:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good looking, and you've got an\Nequally good head on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an eye for people,\Nwhich leads me to my point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hole Horse is a horrible\Nlying bastard, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was manipulating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.18,0:04:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think how your parents would feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't end up like this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's easy when you're in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.10,0:04:24.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you can't afford to see the\Nworld with such a narrow view.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a step back and look\Nat the whole picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.20,0:04:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The city of Varanasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.10,0:04:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sacred river, the Ganges.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.20,0:04:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A place for holy men,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the old and the sick, where domestic\Nanimals and food for human consumption?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.88,0:04:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lie alongside human waste\Nand corpses for cremation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The river embraces all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.18,0:05:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From birth unto death, its holy\Nwaters form a microcosm of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is said that visitors of the sacred\Ncity of Varanasi remain transfixed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never wanting to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the landscape that is this\Nsacred land is a mirror unto the soul.
