Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.06,0:05:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, this thing isn't getting any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.84,0:05:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Gramps?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.40,0:05:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't look well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.22,0:05:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like my bug bite\Njust got a lot worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing must be infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely swollen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be best to have a doctor\Nlook at it before it gets worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, doesn't that sort of\Nlook like a person's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop kidding around, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:05:59.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want me to go to the hospital with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.26,0:06:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.17,0:06:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop treating me like an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.47,0:06:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just lance this. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.78,0:06:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's definitely infected now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll get worse if we\Ndon't drain the fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, can't we just put medicine\Nand a bandage on it and call it a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.20,0:06:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll numb the area so it won't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.54,0:06:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, I studied medicine in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do appendectomies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, it's a little rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.46,0:06:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.48,0:06:53.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's slice it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I don't want to\Nwatch it being cut open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.50,0:06:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.58,0:06:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.56,0:07:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I open my eyes now?
