Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.50,0:07:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.32,0:07:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying to cut me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty stupid move, you old fart!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.78,0:07:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choo-me-me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the empress!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.14,0:07:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As in the empress part, old man Joseph!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, I'm gonna bloody you up, blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.70,0:07:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did you get on me, dammit?
