Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness that\Nwas my artificial hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard, think you can just cut me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a part of your body\Nnow, old man Joseph!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get away from me,\Nhoney, no matter how hard you try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I bet I can tell you what's\Ngoing through that thick skull of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.30,0:08:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're probably thinking something like,\Nonly a stand can beat another stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.92,0:08:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stand, Hermit Purple, has the power\Nof clairvoyance and remote viewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how am I supposed to fight\Nsomething like this with those powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.76,0:08:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I destroy something\Nthat's growing out of my own arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, honey, was that spot on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:44.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the user?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How in the hell could\Nyou have infected me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.60,0:08:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You moron! I won't tell!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Disgusting freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Running off to your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:58.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see how that goes, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:02.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor, your next patient\Nis waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.56,0:09:08.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.02,0:09:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.19,0:09:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed him! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Joseph Joestar, an American!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm staying at Hotel Clark's! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by the way, girly, I have a thing\Nfor hot, young nurses like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.76,0:09:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I should give you an exam!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.20,0:09:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! It's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.66,0:09:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you can't go back to the hotel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all alone now, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can kill you without anyone interfering!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.52,0:09:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.56,0:10:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're pissing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush you to tiny bits!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.00,0:10:05.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your own arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of it, you shitty old man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.06,0:10:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It grew arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much more could it grow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.64,0:10:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean it, freak! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The murderer's over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.64,0:10:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since it's come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Overdrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.76,0:10:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.44,0:10:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your arm, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think your hamon would work against\Nyour own body? Hands up! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.34,0:10:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how about perfect purple?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crushing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can use it this way too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:07.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how does it feel, ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you not to move, now free!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it! What are you\Ndoing? I can't see! Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.22,0:11:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jesus, Mary and Joseph!
