Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.08,0:11:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you get what I'm telling you, Nena?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, real men don't have to talk a big\Ngame like your six-shooting boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you figure out who's a\Nliar and who's the genuine article.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.30,0:11:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn cops have run me\Nin the wrong direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm nowhere near the hotel now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had known this would happen, I\Nwould have taken Polnareff with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:12:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of a petty guy like\NWhole Horse, why not be with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I not your type?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I don't dwell\Non the past like some.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.98,0:12:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care who you were\Ndating before even Whole Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.36,0:12:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's important is the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.42,0:12:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just need to understand\Neach other, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.10,0:12:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look over there, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That place is a hotel run by a\Nnice Japanese woman named Kumiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She manages it with her Indian husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.92,0:12:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can probably get a cheap room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.70,0:12:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.98,0:12:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me more about this hotel.
