Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.86,0:12:53.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.84,0:12:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jummy Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.74,0:12:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm eating, Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:12:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A growing girl needs her food!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.70,0:13:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stole those at the market,\Nyou quick little bastard!
