Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choo-me-mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.76,0:13:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look how big I've gotten! It's tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.22,0:13:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having another mouse to\Nfeed isn't it, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Choo-me-mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You disgusting little cow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.00,0:13:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show you that nobody\Nhas the experience or
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.78,0:13:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the smarts to take down\Nthe great Joseph Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't stand a chance, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now how the hell am I\Ngonna do that? Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:38.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here goes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Daddy dearest, you've done\Na wonderful job of raising me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.10,0:13:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know, you shouldn't tie your\Nchildren down or they won't grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.98,0:13:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it only smothers them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.98,0:13:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should raise them to be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:13:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not, they might rebel!
