Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.70,0:14:01.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had a camera,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could use Hermit Purple to get a\Npicture of the Stan user's location.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.80,0:14:13.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, think, Joseph, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, it won't just be my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll take over my whole body.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.46,0:14:24.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.00,0:14:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.22,0:14:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already grown enough that I could\Neasily end your pathetic life. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.76,0:14:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hand can reach your\Nthroat now, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to bust\Nyour carotid artery and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll crumple over\Nlike a sack of potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.62,0:14:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.78,0:15:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lost his mind! Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some very strange man has a\Nstrange growth on his arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.66,0:15:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.62,0:15:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell's the stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.62,0:15:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to tell you something. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.04,0:15:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a reliable man, a good\Nman like you, to take care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.52,0:15:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I love you, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.96,0:15:36.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a kind-hearted,\Ntrustworthy man you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.28,0:15:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.19,0:15:39.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's all so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.64,0:15:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have finally found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.22,0:15:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,G-g-lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joseph Joestar, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.06,0:16:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You keep getting farther and\Nfarther from Jotaro and the others!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think I'm just\Nrunning around town randomly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing this just to\Nwear myself out, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.46,0:16:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm running so I can kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.26,0:16:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.22,0:16:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a nice soap!
