Dialogue: 2,0:16:55.57,0:16:55.61,SFXBrown2,10,0,0,0,,{=21}{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(753.8,356.47)\frz332.8\4a&HFF&}Stab
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.72,0:16:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:16:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A nail?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I picked it up earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you were rolling around\Non the ground like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.02,0:17:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can shove it right in your carotid\Nand you'll bleed out like a stuck pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you actually believe I'd suffocate\Nif you stuck me in here, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may be made of your flesh,\Nbut I'm nothing like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget the rules already, Chunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a stand can hope to\Ndefeat another stand! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.64,0:17:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say you were gonna show me\Nall that fighting experience you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.70,0:17:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I supposed to be\Nimpressed? So blessed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.94,0:17:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just a helpless geezer who's gotten\Ntoo old to help anyone, even himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.44,0:17:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My prosthetic hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was on the verge of breaking\Nfrom her attack earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now I can't get any strength into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one more push!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your life as an invalid is about\Nto come to an end, if you be mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.22,0:17:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a single\Nway you can defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.86,0:17:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might as well surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.14,0:18:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might as well what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.40,0:18:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, my hearing isn't\Nexactly what it once was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.90,0:18:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run that by me one more time, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.44,0:18:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kultar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.62,0:18:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was your plan all along!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.16,0:18:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't to suffocate me, you\Nwere trying to keep me from moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.94,0:18:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you know there\Nwas Kultar in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With my sands power, Hermit\NPurple told me everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, look! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ashes that foreigners spilled\Neverywhere when he wrecked the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They formed into a\Nperfect map of the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:19:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drew a map with Hermit Purple?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.96,0:19:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how you found the tar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.84,0:19:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A map out of incense ashes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now I think even a glorified ape\Nlike you should see the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in our fighting experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.40,0:19:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When your opponent starts\Nboasting, he's already lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.04,0:19:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That shrew is a line from my wilder days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a fine wine, I guess\NI just get better with age.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.54,0:19:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, a stand will\Ndefeat another stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next you'll say, please\Nstop it, I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please just stop it, I beg you.
