Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But children can't depend\Non their parents forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.92,0:19:50.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you've grown up, you've got\Nto learn to live on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, I wonder where that\Nthing stand user is hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so, what do you say, Nena, darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.02,0:20:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we seal our new\Nlove with a sweet kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.22,0:20:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this? It's nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Nena?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
