Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.50,0:20:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, she was the empress's\Nstand user all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.64,0:20:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was an ugly old troll.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She attached her stand to\Nme as a tumor with a human
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.62,0:20:52.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,face and camouflaged herself\Nas a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She played you like a\Ndamn fiddle, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh!
