Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.48,0:21:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And here I thought we'd finally be\Nable to sleep in a bed for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the old man hadn't screwed up, he\Nwouldn't be out here hiding from the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.40,0:21:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took care of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.16,0:21:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can take this car.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.96,0:21:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, you do the driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're still in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was the one who was\Nattacked by the stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, but I think I'd rather\Nhave gone through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.72,0:22:15.14,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the old paintings on the tomb
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.06,0:22:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don't you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.14,0:22:17.39,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They do the sand dance, don'tcha know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.10,0:22:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you move too quick, oh well!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.39,0:22:18.85,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,If they move too quick
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.65,0:22:22.11,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're falling down like a domino
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.78,0:22:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the buzzer men by the Nile.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.11,0:22:24.44,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the bazaar men by the Nile
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.44,0:22:26.78,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They got the money on a bet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got their money on\Na bed Called crocodiles.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.78,0:22:28.28,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Gold crocodiles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.08,0:22:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-eh-oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.95,0:22:31.41,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.02,0:22:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They snap their teeth on your cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.02,0:22:33.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fallen types of the hookah. I say.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.41,0:22:33.62,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Foreign types with their hookah pipes say
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.26,0:22:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-eh-oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.63,0:22:43.17,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.00,0:22:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.56,0:22:57.02,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,The blonde waitresses take their trays
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.68,0:22:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take their trays, spin around\Nand they cross the floor.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.02,0:22:59.39,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They spin around and they cross the floor
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.06,0:23:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink,\Nthen they bring you more.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.69,0:23:04.02,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,You drop your drink then they bring you more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.76,0:23:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.02,0:23:06.36,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the school kids so sick of books
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.40,0:23:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're like the punk and the metal band.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.36,0:23:08.70,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They like the punk and the metal band
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.44,0:23:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings, they're\Nwalking like an Egyptian.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.70,0:23:10.16,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,When the buzzer rings
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.70,0:23:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.99,0:23:13.33,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,They're walking like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.33,0:23:15.54,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,All the kids in the marketplace say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.34,0:23:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.44,0:23:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an Egyptian?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.67,0:23:25.75,Lyrics 2,,0,0,0,,Walk like an Egyptian
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.84,0:23:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's time to say goodbye to India.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:27.01,0:23:29.01,Next Episode,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,730)}Next Episode
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.26,0:23:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on, I'm a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.12,0:23:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, did you get a look\Nat the driver's face?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.46,0:23:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm saying we don't need\Nany more trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.90,0:23:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.46,0:23:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.26,0:23:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like sumo?
